msgstr ""

#: source/language/builtins.md:351
msgid "`\"base64\"`"
msgstr ""

#: source/language/builtins.md:352
msgid "`\"sri\"`"
msgstr ""

#: source/language/builtins.md:354
msgid ""
"The result hash is the _toHashFormat_ representation of the hash _hash_."
msgstr ""

#: source/language/builtins.md:356 source/language/builtins.md:370
#: source/language/builtins.md:383 source/language/builtins.md:958
#: source/language/builtins.md:980 source/language/builtins.md:1091
#: source/language/builtins.md:1219 source/language/builtins.md:1240
#: source/language/builtins.md:1266 source/language/builtins.md:1427
#: source/language/builtins.md:1452 source/language/builtins.md:1471
#: source/language/builtins.md:1696 source/language/builtins.md:1852
#: source/language/builtins.md:1917 source/language/builtins.md:1936
#: source/language/builtins.md:2226 source/language/builtins.md:2562
msgid "**Example**"
msgstr ""

#: source/language/builtins.md:358
msgid "Convert a SHA256 hash in Base16 to SRI:"
msgstr ""

#: source/language/builtins.md:360
msgid ""
"```nix\n"
"builtins.convertHash {\n"
"  hash = "
"\"e3b0c44298fc1c149afbf4c8996fb92427ae41e4649b934ca495991b7852b855\";\n"
"  toHashFormat = \"sri\";\n"
"  hashAlgo = \"sha256\";\n"
"}\n"
"```"
msgstr ""

#: source/language/builtins.md:368 source/language/builtins.md:394
msgid ""
"    \"sha256-47DEQpj8HBSa+/TImW+5JCeuQeRkm5NMpJWZG3hSuFU=\"\n"
"    "
msgstr ""

#: source/language/builtins.md:372
msgid "Convert a SHA256 hash in SRI to Base16:"
msgstr ""

#: source/language/builtins.md:374
msgid ""
"```nix\n"
"builtins.convertHash {\n"
"  hash = \"sha256-47DEQpj8HBSa+/TImW+5JCeuQeRkm5NMpJWZG3hSuFU=\";\n"
"  toHashFormat = \"base16\";\n"
"}\n"
"```"
msgstr ""

#: source/language/builtins.md:381
msgid ""
"    \"e3b0c44298fc1c149afbf4c8996fb92427ae41e4649b934ca495991b7852b855\"\n"
"    "
msgstr ""

#: source/language/builtins.md:385
msgid "Convert a hash in the form `<hashAlgo>:<hashBody>` in Base16 to SRI:"
msgstr ""

#: source/language/builtins.md:387
msgid ""
"```nix\n"
"builtins.convertHash {\n"
"  hash = "
"\"sha256:e3b0c44298fc1c149afbf4c8996fb92427ae41e4649b934ca495991b7852b855\";\n"
"  toHashFormat = \"sri\";\n"
"}\n"
"```"
msgstr ""

#: source/language/builtins.md:403
msgid ""
"The value of the [`eval-system`](../command-ref/conf-file.md#conf-eval-"
"system) or else [`system`](../command-ref/conf-file.md#conf-system) "
"configuration option."
msgstr ""

#: source/language/builtins.md:409
msgid ""
"It can be used to set the `system` attribute for [`builtins.derivation`](../"
"language/derivations.md) such that the resulting derivation can be built on "
"the same system that evaluates the Nix expression:"
msgstr ""

#: source/language/builtins.md:418
msgid ""
"It can be overridden in order to create derivations for different system "
"than the current one:"
msgstr ""

#: source/language/builtins.md:420
msgid ""
"```console\n"
"$ nix-instantiate --system \"mips64-linux\" --eval --expr "
"'builtins.currentSystem'\n"
"\"mips64-linux\"\n"
"```"
msgstr ""

#: source/language/builtins.md:425 source/language/builtins.md:454
#: source/language/builtins.md:538 source/language/builtins.md:763
#: source/language/builtins.md:882 source/language/builtins.md:918
#: source/language/builtins.md:1100 source/language/builtins.md:1501
#: source/language/builtins.md:1778 source/language/builtins.md:1909
#: source/language/builtins.md:2292 source/language/builtins.md:2345
#: source/language/builtins.md:2548 source/language/builtins.md:2552
