"Has `O(n)` time complexity, where `n` is the size of the _attrset_. Note "
"that no calls to _f_ are performed by the builtin. The function _f_ is "
"called on demand when a resulting attribute value is evaluated."
msgstr ""

#: source/language/builtins.md:2176
