"everything up to but not including the first dash not followed by a letter, "
"and the version is everything following that dash. The result is returned in "
"a set `{ name, version }`. Thus, `builtins.parseDrvName "
"\"nix-0.12pre12876\"` returns `{ name = \"nix\"; version = "
"\"0.12pre12876\"; }`."
msgstr ""

