#: source/language/builtins.md:2728
msgid ""
"This function allows you to define a dependency on an already existing store "
"path. For example, the derivation attribute `src = builtins.storePath /nix/"
"store/f1d18v1y…-source` causes the derivation to depend on the specified "
"path, which must exist or be substitutable. Note that this differs from a "
"plain path (e.g. `src = /nix/store/f1d18v1y…-source`) in that the latter "
"causes the path to be _copied_ again to the Nix store, resulting in a new "
"path (e.g. `/nix/store/ld01dnzc…-source-source`)."
msgstr ""

